abstract: "Advertised prices for home-service trades read from businesses' own public price pages (the Workely Price Index), and binned residential numbers from The Total Wash Co. in Madison, WI (the Open Ledger), plus a JSON Schema for owner pricing rules. The two series are kept separate."
